### CREATE - POST new expense
POST http://localhost:5000/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lunch",
  "amount": 120,
  "category": "Food"
}

###

### GET - Fetch all expenses
GET http://localhost:5000/api/expenses

###

### DELETE - Delete expense by ID (replace with actual _id from MongoDB)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/expenses/PASTE_ID_HERE

###

### UPDATE - Update expense by ID
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/expenses/PASTE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dinner",
  "amount": 200,
  "category": "Food"
}